      "readme": "This dataset includes anatomical and functional images of 24 participants that have performed the local-global task.\n\n Functional images  are: <br>\n- 4 runs partial-brain functional echo planar images (EPI) images centered on the brainstem <br>\n- 2 volumes with opposite phase encoding directions: anterior to posterior direction (AP) and the other direction (PA)\n\nAnatomical images are: <br>\n- 2 partial-brain Turbo Spin Echo (TSE) <br> \n- 1 whole-brain structural T1 image with an MPRAGE sequence \n\nBehavioural, physiological, and pupil data can be found on OSF at <a href=\"https://osf.io/td5kp/\">https://osf.io/td5kp/</a> . \n",
